    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Joanne Vinette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115349560175394707363/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbWfuk4qUPq72XR6nCrJfKIrxBMQpENUvbLFhF5OCp_sCLmw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Many times false publicity on e mails sent that are not honored in the store! Also….you have many nice things…But the prices are so high!  Even when the artclie is 40% off….still really high. Much better prices elsewhere!",
        "time": 1766269330,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Terri-lynn Young",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112900425616493725371/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKZEQxH21aFKRzP8cFjQAf6jfXjeCLEKArlTzT4Cyj8mEAA7g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I visited the Vaudreuil store today and I was so very disappointed.  The clothing selection was very limited and the service we received was disinterested at best. My daughter requested to be measured for bra size and it was done wrong. When we questioned the clerk, she assured us it was right. Of course when she tried that size, shockingly they didn't fit. I'm incredibly disappointed.",
        "time": 1743970897,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Evangeline Flowerday",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103391425931651675121/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVoReM2n1c4cv2WljOU0W9IbBd8LxxdmWq68FnBJSbQVEC6mElz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Very nice and helpful staff. They are so knowledgeable about their products, it was a breeze finding nice clothes that fit just right!",
        "time": 1747244921,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maria Palmieri",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113402396279627228810/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIxJkVQKejYYca4Hh8914u4gc8aZcuUz_LE73Lli4XdzeSnkA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Absolutely no service. Needed help finding a bra that fit and did not know my size, I had to rummage through the packed hanging bras that weren’t even organized by size. Took forever. I finally found one and would have loved the same in black but didn’t have the heart to search for one and decided to forget about it. At the cash after spending $100.00 I was asked if I wanted to buy a bag for my purchases! Really! So I walked out bra and undies in hand. You must be kidding me! You can’t supply your customers with a paper bag!!! 🤬",
        "time": 1661789330,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Patricia Venne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116975561468644374765/reviews",
